  <Client>k__BackingField: {fileID: 11400000, guid: ac6f33e371697904aa409cc4b2ae4bfd, type: 2}
  <TextContent>k__BackingField: 'Dear,

    I am an artist, I am Rowan, you see.

    I
    am in search of colours, yes. Rather colourful ones at that.

    I see leaves,
    bushes, nay I see trees. But of course, I am witnessing the forest!

    I need
    it in the shortest delays. My canvas beckons me.

    Awaiting your wonders,'
  <LetterType>k__BackingField: 0
